  "worked_solution": "The number $2%$ (expressed as a decimal) is equal to $0.02.$ Therefore, a decrease of $0.02%$ corresponds to multiplication by a factor of:\n\n$$\n1-0.02=0.98\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n- After $1$ day, there will be $400\\cdot (0.98)$ TVs remaining.\n\n- After $2$ days, there will be approximately $400\\cdot (0.98)^{2}$ TVs remaining.\n\n- After $3$ days, there will be approximately $400\\cdot (0.98)^{3}$ TVs remaining.",
